ent, amid a wider discussion around its responsible usage and safety. Klein", "published_at": "2026-09-25T16:31:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-856e20d6ca4e.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15d80e892a00", "title": "AI and the Productivity Trap: A Finance Perspective", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/in-depth/d01262/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/in-depth/3074461/3074461.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "投资", "科技"], "excerpt": "What is the point of AI if employees are expected to do more work, at greater intensity, in the same hours? The Daiichi Life Research Institute’s Kashiwamura", "published_at": "2026-09-23T21:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-15d80e892a00.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15ee8d30b087", "title": "拆解下阿里的 AI 经济学，与它的下注", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370865", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/f2/4a/f24ad16054b704027f7e33527256925b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "作者｜张鹏\n\n\n编辑｜ 苏子华\n\n9 月 22 日，杭州云栖大会。阿里巴巴集团 CEO 吴泳铭和往年一样，做了开场的主旨演讲。\n\n\n过去几年云栖大会的主旨演讲，可以当作「技术风向标」来听，会抛出很多重磅的技术判断，比如，「大模型是下一代操作系统」、「超级 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-23T06:02:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "bodies/feed-15ee8d30b087.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b2afcc1706bd", "title": "派早报：微软高管称 AI 爬取是人类历史上最大的劳动成果盗窃", "source": "少数派", "author": "少数派编辑部", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114788", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/9/21/2026/article/ca2a684d-9b65-b74e-f13c-de6f3eeda594.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "微软高管称 AI 爬取是人类历史上最大的劳动成果盗窃\n\n据 Ars Technica 报道，《纽约时报》等媒体起诉微软与 OpenAI 的版权侵权案近期解封了一批诉讼文件。根据这些文件，微软应用科学总监 Brent Hecht 曾多次在内部预警，表示为训练 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-20T22:26:04Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-21T11:11:41Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b2afcc1706bd.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-9265f1e9dff7", "title": "中信证券评8月经济：出口强劲、投资改善、消费偏弱，房价已具备止跌基础", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "中信证券研究", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782131", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/content_default_15.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "8月产需两端表现分化，工业生产景气强于需求端景气，三驾马车呈现“出口强劲、投资改善、消费偏弱”格局。生产侧，工业增加值增速超预期回升，主要是出口、投资单月同比读数提升促进工业品需求，但消费增速放缓拖累服务业生产景气小幅下滑。需求侧，受补贴同比退坡及补贴透支效应、金价高位震荡上行等因素影响，社零增速低于前值和预期；8月专", "published_at": "2026-09-19T08:11:09Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-19T11:32:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-9265f1e9dff7.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-4a76657f00cc", "title": "摩根大通：加息并不足以终结美股涨势，长端利率、财政与地缘才是真正的风险", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782077", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/4cd3cd03-5510-46a8-bc9c-49f91708f7e8.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "美联储于当地时间周三宣布加息25个基点后，市场并未延续此前的避险交易，反而在次日出现剧烈反转：美国股市、债市同步走高，AI芯片股领涨科技板块，空头集中平仓进一步放大涨势。周四，标普500指数收复50日均线，纳斯达克指数领涨主要股指，此前遭抛售的AI芯片股也出现强劲反弹。\n\n\n市场的剧烈反转，也与摩根大通战略研究部9月1", "published_at": "2026-09-18T09:50:06Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-18T10:12:20Z", "body": "bodies/feed-4a76657f00cc.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-88ed88e9e7f4", "title": "日本央行行长植田和男：将根据经济和物价情况继续加息", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782067", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d0/24/94/-1-2-.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "周五（9月18日），日本央行行长植田和男在记者会上表示，随着企业加薪意愿增强、定价行为趋于积极，中长期通胀预期持续上升，日本潜在通胀率存在超过2%目标的上行风险。他强调，将根据经济和物价走势继续推进加息，同时将物价趋势稳定在2%左右视为核心政策目标。\n\n植田和男称，受人工智能需求旺盛、原油价格近期回升以及日元持续偏弱等", "published_at": "2026-09-18T06:38:07Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-18T10:12:20Z", "body": "bodies/feed-88ed88e9e7f4.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-87a3330862ff", "title": "Drama Around A PS5 Exploit, AI-Coding, Linux, And GTA 6 Has One Popular Hacker Calling It Quits", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Zack Zwiezen", "url": "https://kotaku.com/popular-playstation-hacker-calling-it-quits-due-to-ai-using-slop-kiddies-reporting-important-bug-to-sony-2000735105", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/04/gta5hack-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏", "科技"], "excerpt": "A prominent PlayStation modder and hacker has had enough. He was working on a project to bring Linux to newer PS5 models running more recent firmware when he", "published_at": "2026-09-16T18:20:26