 "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782799", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d627e820-2bbc-4fb5-a99f-90dbb54c4de5.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "9月30日，A股早盘集体高开，三大股指盘初震荡上涨，盘中深成指、创业板转跌，生物科技板块爆发，CRO、创新药、疫苗等概念股普遍拉升，汽车、煤炭、海运、石油化工等板块走强，房地产显著承压，万科一度跌停。半导体调整，先进封装，GPU等概念股下挫。\n\n\n港股低开低走，恒指、恒科指双双下跌，科网股多数走低，芯片股承压，兆易创新", "published_at": "2026-09-30T02:29:11Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-30T11:12:38Z", "body": "bodies/feed-07b51e7a63e6.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-1a42990fc693", "title": "The Witcher 3 Remastered Just Broke A Steam Record As People Rush Back To Play A New And Improved Version Of One Of The Best RPGs Ever", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Ethan Gach", "url": "https://kotaku.com/the-witcher-3-remastered-just-broke-a-steam-record-as-people-rush-back-to-play-a-new-and-improved-version-of-one-of-the-best-rpgs-ever-2000738418", "image_url": "https://kotaku.com/app/uploads/2026/09/ss_c6d0b7eee8d40b55d33621fcd700151f3325b501.1920x1080-1280x720.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Kotaku", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt — Remastered is out today and propelling the 11-year-old open-world RPG back up the Steam charts. In fact, the game just broke a new", "published_at": "2026-09-29T20:20:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-30T11:12:38Z", "body": "bodies/feed-1a42990fc693.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-23810133ce75", "title": "Dune: Awakening On PS5 Is Making Me Break My Rule Against Playing Survival Games", "source": "Kotaku", "author": "Zack Zwiezen", "url": "https://kotaku.com/