ed-86320b38a747.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-a119b16ea3f8", "title": "AI 圈杀出新顶流，神秘「太空兔」能用涂鸦做网站", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "张子豪", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682401?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6abb827d667b7.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n我们先随手画了一张草图，就像一张粗糙的涂鸦。\n\n\n一个圆圈代表唱片，几条波浪线代表介绍，旁边画个框写上「买」；下面再摆几张大小不一的卡片，其中一张打个叉，表示已经售罄。最后在购物袋旁边画一根箭头，提醒页面要「从右边出来」。\n\n如果把这样一张草图交给设计师，大概还得先解释半天我们到底想要什么。这次我们直接把它丢给了一个", "published_at": "2026-09-29T09:19:53Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a119b16ea3f8.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c06c527a5f73", "title": "Adorable, Approachable Androids? New Japanese Takes on Robotic Companions", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/japan-topics/g02620/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/japan-topics/3078649/3078649.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "日语学习"], "excerpt": "Around the world, capable, powerful robots are appearing to take on challenging tasks in industrial, military and other fields. Here we look at Japanese", "published_at": "2026-09-28T21:00:07Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c06c527a5f73.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c4a051b2cc81", "title": "This Massive, Deep-Sea Roly Poly Can Go Years Without Food Thanks to a Huge Stomach and a Stolen Gene, Study Suggests", "source": "Smithsonian", "author": "", "url": "https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-massive-deep-sea-roly-poly-can-go-years-without-food-thanks-to-a-huge-stomach-and-a-stolen-gene-study-suggests-180989562/", "image_url": "https://th-thumbnailer.cdn-si-edu.com/QudtuopIktixl56roqNNsgIAwY8=/420x240/filters:focal(2448x1632:2449x1633)/https://tf-cmsv2-smithsonianmag-media.s3.amazonaws.com/filer_public/5c/44/5c444071-f699-425f-bd7f-a3a0d76e4647/w020260608495789892714.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Learning", "topic": "history", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Learning", "Smithsonian", "en", "history", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "This Massive, Deep-Sea Roly Poly Can Go Years Without Food Thanks to a Huge Stomach and a Stolen Gene, Study Suggests\n\nThe ancestors of the giant isopod", "published_at": "2026-09-28T19:53:41Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c4a051b2cc81.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-cbc8c7bd2c96", "title": "OpenAI发布AI训练安全准则：失控就叫停，高管拥有一票否决权！", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782724", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/68b6d4e3-dbf3-4204-a8d8-4e0a6df48c2b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻"], "excerpt": "OpenAI正式为前沿AI训练划定安全红线。这家全球最具影响力的人工智能公司发布了一套针对前沿AI训练的安全准则框架，要求在启动或继续任何前沿强化学习训练之前，必须完成系统性的安全论证文件，并赋予高级管理层对训练任务的一票否决权。\n\n\n据OpenAI官方博客，该准则涵盖技术防护、运营管理与失准事件调查三大板块，核心要求", "published_at": "2026-09-29T07:29:15Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-cbc8c7bd2c96.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d6fa27c327ba", "title": "Experts worry about Nvidia's AI chip sales in China and influence over Trump", "source": "Ars Technica", "author": "Ashley Belanger", "url": "https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/09/nvidia-may-sell-more-chips-in-china-as-jensen-huangs-influence-over-trump-grows/", "image_url": "https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296993009-1024x648.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Ars Technica", "Tech", "en", "tech", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "On its face, the recent summit between Donald Trump and China’s president Xi Jinping didn’t change much in the world of AI regulation. Export controls were not", "published_at": "2026-09-28T21:49:10Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-d6fa27c327ba.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-edfdc1e6fd31", "title": "The Nations League is a welcome example of soccer done well", "source": "Guardian Football", "author": "Jonathan Wilson", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/sep/28/nations-league-uefa-england-spain", "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/6f271df80e2584d8e941d8cbad973e372c418578/0_0_5000_4000/master/5000.jpg?width=1200&height=630&quality=85&auto=format&fit=crop&precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&overlay-width=100p&overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctZGVmYXVsdC5wbmc&enable=upscale&s=febe6f51d0420801842d6bbdbe0fc599", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Guardian Football", "Sports", "en", "soccer", "text", "足球"], "excerpt": "England’s first game after the 2022 World Cup was a 2-1 win away over Italy. Their first game after the 2018 World Cup was a 2-1 defeat to Spain. Their first", "published_at": "2026-09-28T15:15:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-edfdc1e6fd31.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f56a80b69e14", "title": "苏姿丰550亿元买下李飞飞世界模型，AI 圈两位女王联手了", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682291?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/3-3.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n就在刚刚，芯片巨头 AMD 正式官宣，将收购李飞飞创立仅两年的 AI 独角兽 World Labs。\n\n\n本次交易将以全股票方式进行，作价约 82 亿美元。目前双方已经签署最终协议，预计在 2026 年底前完成交易，但仍须获得监管批准并满足其他常规交割条件。\n\n\n交易完成后，李飞飞将出任 AMD", "published_at": "2026-09-29T08:15:52Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f56a80b69e14.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}], "status": {"exhausted": false, "next_crawl_at": "2026-10-01T06:10:00-04:00", "inventory_count": 3244}}